          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mam abala ebe kinacata cut idotea luka akwapin kanu, arai ikeraŋak, arai ikaŋatak, karaida ŋul luemaete aputosia, naarai arai kerai kwaŋin ti ibusakinit anyoun kakwapin kanu. ",
